msgstr "Налог в основу"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1884
msgid "Include collected tax in the commission base"
msgstr "Включить собранный налог в базу комиссии"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1889
msgid ""
"Leave off so tax your gateway collects is set aside before the split and not "
